# Indexer / tooling exclusions that must live in the repo, not in a user's
# global editor config, so every contributor and every agent sees the same
# view of the project.
#
# `.worktrees/` is a full git worktree containing complete checkouts of
# feature/global-readiness-phase-a, -b, and feature/production-oj. That is
# 47k+ files that duplicate main's symbols. It is gitignored, but ignoring
# alone did not stop indexing. Excluded here so symbol lookup and search
# resolve to main instead of an arbitrary mix of branch copies.
.worktrees/
Reference_Projects/
backups/
node_modules/
web/dist/
web/e2e/artifacts/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
docs/
